      "text": "L, K, V = 157, 12450, 955 * 1024\nfor i in range(1, 20):\n    b = (L * i + 7) // 8\n    if K * b <= V:\n        best = i\nprint(2 ** best)",
      "originalText": "L, K, V = 157, 12450, 955 * 1024\nfor i in range(1, 20):\n    b = (L * i + 7) // 8\n    if K * b <= V:\n        best = i\nprint(2 ** best)",
