      "updated": 1794488086764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "L, K, V = 105, 65536, 7 * 2 ** 20\nfor i in range(1, 20):\n    b = (L * i + 7) // 8\n    if K * b >= V:\n        print(2 ** (i - 1) + 1)\n        break",
