      "locked": false,
      "text": "N = 10 + 120\ni = 0\nwhile 2 ** i < N:\n    i += 1\nK, V = 12755226, 5 * 2 ** 30\nfor L in range(1, 5000):\n    if K * ((L * i + 7) // 8) <= V:\n        best = L\nprint(best)",
      "originalText": "N = 10 + 120\ni = 0\nwhile 2 ** i < N:\n    i += 1\nK, V = 12755226, 5 * 2 ** 30\nfor L in range(1, 5000):\n    if K * ((L * i + 7) // 8) <= V:\n        best = L\nprint(best)",
