      "text": "L, K, V = 261, 252500, 31 * 2 ** 20\nfor i in range(1, 20):\n    b = (L * i + 7) // 8\n    if K * b > V:\n        print(2 ** (i - 1) + 1)\n        break",
      "originalText": "L, K, V = 261, 252500, 31 * 2 ** 20\nfor i in range(1, 20):\n    b = (L * i + 7) // 8\n    if K * b > V:\n        print(2 ** (i - 1) + 1)\n        break",
