      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "N = 10 + 52 + 963\ni = 0\nwhile 2 ** i < N:\n    i += 1\nK, V = 2000, 693 * 1024\nfor L in range(1, 5000):\n    if K * ((L * i + 7) // 8) <= V:\n        best = L\nprint(best)",
      "originalText": "N = 10 + 52 + 963\ni = 0\nwhile 2 ** i < N:\n    i += 1\nK, V = 2000, 693 * 1024\nfor L in range(1, 5000):\n    if K * ((L * i + 7) // 8) <= V:\n        best = L\nprint(best)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
