      "text": "N = 10 + 52 + 500\ni = 0\nwhile 2 ** i < N:\n    i += 1\nK, V = 45877, 49 * 2 ** 20\nfor L in range(1, 5000):\n    if K * ((L * i + 7) // 8) > V:\n        print(L)\n        break",
      "originalText": "N = 10 + 52 + 500\ni = 0\nwhile 2 ** i < N:\n    i += 1\nK, V = 45877, 49 * 2 ** 20\nfor L in range(1, 5000):\n    if K * ((L * i + 7) // 8) > V:\n        print(L)\n        break",
